{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t美國國家安全局星期二公布，局方用於內部通訊的網絡系統，在一次定期維護期間，出現短暫網速下降，影響系統部分功能，局方重申，系統的關鍵任務能力保持全面正常運作，但美國國家安全局的聲明並無交代事故原因。<br/>\n<br/>\n美國總統特朗普回應說，類似事件間中都會發生，形容是無法避免。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T22:21:41.002755+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T21:55:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:56:18.762220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T22:15:11.543030+00:00","content_hash":"ce11cbaca98ef83656f75df108f51aa97a0a8fa14d48f28d4b110a7034ad7fdc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}